""
""
"The emaciated figure of a human is before you, hovering in mid-air, his
thin, boney frame no longer able to support weight.  Despite his physical
weakness, you know true fear looking at Croazner, for his form crackles
with more energy than any one mortal creature was ever meant to possess... 
and you can see in his eyes that he wants more.
"
