thigh level, and his body contains a good deal of muscle.  His jaw is strong
and his teeth are sharp.  This dog knows how to take care of himself.  As you
look in his eyes, you see a loyalty that will be gained through kindness and
regular feedings.  His fur may be matted, but his heart is pure.
