"This regal man dominates the room with his presence.  He towers over
twenty-five feet tall.  His hair is a shiny silver, as is his beard that has
been finely trimmed around his face and jaw.  Gentle, clear blue eyes gaze out
comtemplatively at everything before him.  His arms and legs are extremely
muscular and well-defined.  His skin is free of blemishes save for a scar on
his left arm that runs several inches long.
"
