"Although his facial expression appears aloof, this twenty-five foot man's
eyebrows arch as though contemplating something deeply.  Dark curly hair
adorns the top of his head that reaches down to the back of his shoulders.  A
trimmed beard graces his strong jawline.  His physique is imposing with a
muscular chest.  Positioned across his body are massive arms that are tightly
defined and free of blemishes.  Supporting his impressive frame are powerfully
built, hairless legs.
"
"Olah"
""
