them.  They find that their hearts are in the right place but that, perhaps,
the calling just isn't there.  There is no shame in stepping down where you
are unable to continue and allowing others to take your place so that the
greatest good can be served most effectively.@n\"
"
E
"releasing2"
"He concludes, \"@GAll you need to do to leave the Shuvanaguard is to return
your longsword to me and you will be released from your duties and
obligations.  Once you do so, however, you can not rejoin.@n\"
"
E
"easy_release"
"The High Druid nods to himself and says, \"@GPerhaps the joining requirements
are too difficult for you or, perhaps, you have simply found that this is not
the path for you.  No matter, you are released from the questing and will not
be held to you.  Fare you well on your journeys wherever they may take you.@n\"
"
!
