of the few open practicioners of his dark arts.  He is clad in dark robes from
head to toe, the black cowl pulled forward to completely hide his face. 
Glints of glowing @rred@n eyes can be seen flickering beneath the hood, an eerie
manifestation of demonic and unholy power.  Soft gloves of black leather cover
his hands, leaving no flesh exposed for determination of this priest's race.
"
