""
"A man dressed in rags stands here.  His face is dominated by a large nose that
resemble the beak of a parrot.  Two beady black eyes peer at you from under a
heavy brow, like a bird looking at a worm.  His peeling lips are dry and
chapped, As they curl back to form a gruesome leer, row after row of teeth
become visible.  They look like giant yellowing thorns, ones at the outer most
edge of his mouth are the largest.  Even though the teeth decrease in size as
they retreat into the depths of his mouth, you do not think they are any less
sharp.
"
"S'ynn"
""
""
