squinting eyes go white wide.  This only lasts a moment, though, until he sees
you aren't here to hurt him.  Once he's quite sure you are just here to ask
him about the shipment he looks a bit more sure of himself and says, \"@GAs to
that, ahem, well there's a bit of a problem, you see.@n\"
