"introduce"
"When you first arrived here in town, you didn't know a soul.  When you look at
others, you can only see their @bappearance@n, and that is all they see when you
pass them by as well.  In order to know them by name, you must @bintroduce@n
yourself to them in a language they understand.  To do so, type @bintroduce
<target person>@n.  You may need to switch to their language by typing @blanguage
<their language>@n, assuming that you in fact know their language.  As you
become friendly with your acquaintances, you may wish to @bbefriend@n them, so
that they are able to help you get your corpse should you die.  For a friendly
cleric to summon you, you will need to @bconsent@n them.
