""
"enormous"
"- please contact an immortal."
"From nose to tail, this intimidating crystal dragon stretches nearly thirty
feet in length.  Beautiful, scintillating scales cover the length of her body,
some the size of a tiny fingernail, while others on her back are as large as
the door of a house.  A long, spiked tail lies coiled around her body, the
triangular tip slowly swaying side to side.  Her eyes are not one color, but
instead seem to gradually change hues over time.  Both magnificent and clearly
ancient, she regards you with a gaze suggestive of great wisdom and a great
hunger for knowledge that has not faded over the eons.
"
"Terek"
