"lithely stalks the area."
"Ral'airdn"
""
""
"warily watch each other."
"Before you is one of nature's most lethal predators, the rare and beautiful
Ral'Airdn.  More than anything else, it could be said to resemble a massive
wild cat if a wild cat were nearly the size of an elephant and covered in
green fur.  Its green fur is striated with the subtle shades of green broken
by darker brown bands that help it to blend in seemlessly in its native
woodland habitat.  Its mouth, large enough to easily encompass the head of an
ogre is a nightmare maw of sharp fangs and two long, almost sabre-like, fangs
in particular that jut down from the upper front ridge of teeth.  From the
center of its more or less feline forehead just a long, narrow horn that first
curves up then curves forward again before tapering to its sharp point.  The
horn, like its claws are a dark brown touched with hues of natural red.
"
