""
"patrol the steppe."
"This muscular being is some sort of demi-human species.  Its skin is a dark
crimson, dull and tough.  Ridges run the length of its arms, ending as they
reach its wrists.  Its hands are a slightly paler shade of red, with long
fingers and hardened claws.  Numerous spines protude along a line from its
neck to its back, which is also slightly humped.  Its face is grotesque with
abnormal bumps and fractures everywhere.  Long, jagged, irregular teeth crowd
its fearful mouth, which sits without grace beneath two glowering, black eyes.
Its disproportionately large legs have three claws in the front and one in the
back.
"
