"A cross between a fox and a hound, this dog exemplifies the nobler features of
both.  Its body is muscular but sleek, barely betraying the speed its limbs
are capable of.  Short but pointed, the dog's muzzle ends in a wet black
nose.  The dog's thick fur is lustrous and shiny, its argent color looking all
the world like molten silver.  Like its fur, the silver dog has silver eyes
which hold more than animal intelligence.
"
