"story"
"The clearing you see before you is very old.  The trees whose branches shelter
this clearing and create the canopy were here since the beginning of time. 
The clearing is the home of the dragon hatchery.  Every dragon that ever
existed started under this very canopy.  The rocks you see there to the east
are not rocks but eggs.  Some have been here for hundreds of years waiting for
their time to hatch.  A great magic covers this clearing, allowing many
climates to exist.  It enforces harmony in the clearing--no dragons fight each
other here.
"
