Peering from behind her hair are a pair of large round eyes the color of
sparkling turquoise.  At over fifteen feet in height, her physique is imposing
yet her movements as graceful and elegant as a ballerina's.  Her skin is milky
white as though she is unaffected by the sun's light.  Long, shapely arms and
legs extend from her remarkably well-toned body.
