"Before you is a giant reptilian creature with scarlet scales and spots of
brown.  Multiple heads rest on long snaking necks that dance unnervingly
around each other.  Its body is quite bulky and is supported with thick stout
legs.  A long tail lies docile at its side tapering into multiple ends.
