""
"with long, sinuous bodies writhe on the ground."
"This crimson serpent has vestigial wings growing from its flame-colored back. 
Its ice-blue eyes are reptilian and glimmer with intelligence.  Nearly ten
feet long and six feet tall, this drake makes a formidable foe.
