has been awakened within the depths of the Nine Hells.  The last time he
awoke several races were exterminated.  To put it in simple terms, he is
a Tanar'ai demon, one of the worst kind.  He is able to control hordes of
demons at his own free will.\" 
"
E
"demons1"
