considering her beauty.  A silken robe covers her soft ivory skin.  Though
curvaceous by elven standards, her build is still slender.  Her long blond
hair falls nearly to her waist, and shines like gold around her delicate
face.  Her large blue eyes seem almost startled as she looks up, noticing your
glance, and her soft skin begins to blush.  A tentative smile crosses her
lips, as she begins to fuss with the pillows around her to keep looking up
again.
"
"Olah"
