"clockwork beast"
""
"metallic"
"prowls about."
"clockwork beasts"
""
"metallic"
"prowl about."
"A hideous beast, crafted from a variety of metal, stares at you through
glowing red orbs.  Its head is arrow-shaped, and pointy ridges, stained in
red function is its teeth.  Powerful steel claws look ready to rip
through meat, as it assumes a battle-ready position.  A long metal tail
rolls down its back.  Sticking straight out of its bronze-plated back is
a piece of metal shaped in such a way that one could possibly wind it up,
should one be able to get there.
"
"Olah"
""
""
"attack( mob, victim, 4d5+15, \"vicious bite\" );
attack( mob, victim, 4d6+10, \"razor-claw slash\" );
if( random( 1, 10 ) < 8 )
  attack( mob, victim, 5d6+10, \"diagonal claw\" );
if( random( 1, 10 ) < 4 ) {
  act_tochar( #bite, ch );
  act_notchar( #nbite, ch );
  dam_message( ch, 3d5+8, \"The clockwork beast's digging bite\" );
  inflict( ch, mob, 3d5+8, \"A clockwork beast's digging bite\" );
  }
if( random( 1, 4 ) == 4 ) {
  send_to_room( #spin, room );
  loop( all_in_room ) {
    if( is_player( rch ) ) {
      if( random( 1, 10 ) < 8 )
        attack( mob, rch, 5d6+10, \"razor spin\" );
} } }
"
