"crimson ghoul"
""
""
"stands in a low crouch, bloody hands touching the ground."
"crimson ghoul"
""
""
"stand in a decaying pack."
"Thin and wiry, this twisted abomination is nearly unrecognizable as once being
human.  The skin hangs loosely on his frame, stained the color of aged
blood-rust.  Skeletal claws, crusted with blood and twitching with hunger,
drag the ground.  Nearly all of the muscle and fat have melted away, leaving
only an emaciated shell of a man.  Most inhuman of all are the creatures eyes;
the whites of the eyes have turned to a deep, blood-red, giving the ghoul an
alien look, much like a shark.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
"i = 0;
k = 2+1d2;
loop( i < k ) {
  j = 10d16+20;
  if( attack( mob, victim, j, \"skeletal claw\" ) ) {
    if( 1d3 != 2 )
      do_spell( paralyze, mob, victim, 15 );
    heal( mob, j*2 );
  }
  i++;
}
if( attack( mob, victim, 1d200+5, \"foul bite\" ) )
  poison( victim );
"
