dots on its cheeks.  Flowing from the top of its head are orange woolen
strands.  Covering most of its body is a combination of bright blue circles
and a plaid design, giving off and odd, contrasting appearance.  Its hands
look proportionally larger than its body, and its feet are almost as long as
its fluffy legs.
