fading in and out of reality.  Dressed in shining armor remembered from his
days of glory, the ghost's form wavers visibly when approached.  Streaming
unchecked down his spectral face, tears of infinite sadness fade and vanish
after they fall from his transparent cheeks.  Sensing he is not alone, the
ghost of Sir Gallopalot drifts higher off the cold, stone floor as his image
steadies and grows noticeably brighter.
"
"Florian"
