""
"enticing"
"watch over the rest of the women."
"Stunningly beautiful, this vyan woman seems very serious.  Her dark skin is
flawless, and her long black hair is pulled back, revealing beautiful
shoulders and a slender neck.  She keeps an eye on the entire area, and every
once in a while whispers something to the another women.  Seeing how they
jump, one could only assume she is giving orders.  Slowly she looks you over,
trying to decide how best to please you, suddenly she whispers something into
the ear of another woman, who promptly grins and looks your way.
"
