flow, this woman absently runs her hand across her stunning body.  Slowly, she
glides under the water, her dark body moving in a single fluid motion.  Losing
sight for a moment, you finally see her surface near the woman she had been
watching so intently.  As other woman notices her, she moves seductively
closer.  Slowly she begins to massage the other woman's shoulders, glancing at
you with a look of sheer delight, she beckons you into the water.
"
