"shapely human women"
""
""
"wade through the shallow end of the pool."
"Amazing doesn't even begin to describe this woman.  The shallow water, at this
end of the pool, reaches just above mid thigh, giving you a full view of this
gorgeous human.  Her slim waist and shapely hips shimmer as the water runs
off, and her small two-piece bathing suit does little to conceal her full
chest.  Her dark brown hair is pulled back, so only a few curls dance across
the back of her neck.  As she walks toward you, every movement is filled with
a grace only an angel could possess.  Before you can react, she scoops a
handful of water and splashes you, soaking you thoroughly.  Softly she mumbles
something about needing to dry you off.
"
"Olah"
""
""
