"
E
"bite"
"@gThe ettercap sinks its cruel mandibles deep into your flesh, and suddenly rips them out!@n
"
E
"rbite"
"@gThe ettercap sinks its cruel mandibles deep into $n's flesh, and suddenly rips them out!@n
"
E
"rend"
"@yThe ettercap latches onto you with both claws and begins rending with its hind claws!@n
"
E
"rrend"
"@yThe ettercap latches onto $n with both claws and begins rending with its hind claws!@n
