"This hideous beast possesses the wings and body of an enormous, black
eagle, and the head of a fiendish, demonic stag.  A rack of bloodied
antlers crowns its head, and two rows of vicious, razor-sharp teeth
clearly illustrate that this beast's diet consists primarily of flesh. 
As you pull your gaze from these loathsome aberrations, you notice that
the shadow they cast is of a humanoid figure...
"
"Zithuan"
""
""
"attack( mob, victim, 2d11+6, \"sharp talon\" );
attack( mob, victim, 2d11+6, \"sharp talon\" );
if( random( 1, 5 ) < 3 ) {
  if( attack( mob, victim, 8d5+8, \"charge\" ) ) {
    interpret( mob, \"bash\" );
    if( is_resting( victim ) ) {
      act_tochar( #heart_rip, victim );
      act_notchar( #rheart_rip, victim );
      i = 8d9+12;
      dam_message( victim, i, \"A peryton's attempted heart rip\" );
      inflict( victim, mob, i, \"Peryton\" );
      }
    else
      attack( mob, victim, 4d9+8, \"vicious fanged bite\" );
    }
  }
else
  attack( mob, victim, 6d5+8, \"antler swipe\" );
"
