"This cow is much larger than the average cow, its shoulder about level with
that of a troll.  Its eyes are red and gleam with the touch of madness.
Foaming saliva hangs from the corners of its mouth, and its tail twitches
wildly.  Strangely enough, a pair of colossal wings, membraneous like those of
a bat, sprout from its shoulders.
"
"Altimeas"
