"This battle-harded skeleton stands little over four feet tall, but his
thick bones give him an eerily solid appearance for one with no flesh. 
Many battle scars have chipped away bits of bone and several ancient
wounds have taken their toll in the form of fractured ribs.  His hollow
eye sockets now glare out emptily, longing for revenge on clan mates who
left him to die.
"
"Zithuan"
""
