"A girl of about fifteen with long, somewhat wild black hair.  Her
floor-length dress is bright scarlet, an almost blinding flash of colour
against her surroundings.  Around her neck is a necklace that might have
been made by a child, with pieces of straw braded together and tiny
carved snails circled around it.  Her pale blue eyes are large and
vacant, as if she were asleep with her eyes open, and her nose is oddly
crooked.  Though her back is straight, she manages to walk with a slouch.
"
"Elfir"
