"Sir Jormleif"
""
"spectre of a knight"
""
"noble, proud"
"stands firmly at attention."
"noble knight"
""
""
"are here"
"Noble even in death, this sturdy knight holds himself at attention at nearly
six feet in height.  The knight wears ghostly silvery chainmail sleeves and
leggings and a glimmeringly polished steel breastplate engraved with a lance
crossed with a rose.  While the knight's clothing seems tenuous and ghostly,
his weapon seems entirely real, held at the ready in a sturdy grip.  From
beneath his helm, a shock of coal-black hair streaked with white can be made
out above steely blue eyes; his gaze is tinged with sadness and eyes lined
with worry.
"
"Nereus"
""
""
