""
"fire-shrouded"
"glows with a crimson light."
"ruby golems"
""
"fire-shrouded"
"glow with a crimson light."
"Looming nearly nine feet tall and half as broad through the shoulders,
the crimson corundum forming this menacing construct seems almost to be
liquid, faceted fire, glowing from within as though lit by an inner lamp. 
Sparks of iridescent ruby flutter throught the golem's translucent body,
lending the creature a pretense of blood churning through its crystalline
structure.  Massive arms and legs, thicker than the trunks of many trees,
bulge with manufactured muscle, hinting at the enormous strength of this
terrible creation.  Faceted eyes of onyx stare stupidly .from their
proper placement on the golem's squared, block-like head, dulled and
unseeing.  An aura of sullen crimson tinged with deepest midnight
radiates from the construct in an unholy halo, distorting anything that
falls within its ruddy shadow.
"
"Zithuan"
""
""
