""
"powerful, dragon-like"
"is prepared to attack."
"emerald golems"
""
"powerful, dragon-like"
"are prepared to attack."
"Supple and sinuous is this creature of living emerald.  Though standing
no more than eight feet tall, the golem's lean, agile-looking form gives
the illusion of rather a greater height.  This creation would seem almost
to be the bizarre product of an unholy union between human and dragon;
neither fully one nor fully the other, it bears some characteristics of
each.  Its head is elongated, almost forming a snout, with vicious fangs
readily apparent behind its savage jaws.  Its form is mostly human in
shape, save the vestigal wings sprouting from its shoulders.  Facets of
light gleam from its pure emerald scales, dazzling and almost blinding in
their brilliance.
"
"Zithuan"
""
""
