""
"shadowy figure"
"cloaked in darkness,"
""
"stands with her head bowed, deep in contemplation."
"shadowy figures"
"cloaked in darkness,"
""
"stand with their heads bowed, deep in contemplation."
"Hidden within a cloak of all-encompassing darkness is a tall figure,
almost painfully slender.  Beneath the shadow cast by the heavy hood,
however, is a face of startling loveliness, though the expression in the
dark woman's deep sapphire eyes is colder than ice.  The ebony robes she
wears loudly proclaim her calling as a priestess of Temohpab, the
insignia of the Black Unicorn emblazoned upon them.  A small unholy
symbol in the shape of a rampant unicorn wrought in silver is clutched
tightly in one gaunt, white hand, nerveless fingers caressing it without
cease.
"
"Arrkyrael"
""
""
