"lurk in the shadows."
"Before you is a cunning creature, covered with thick, dull grey scales and
rippling with muscle.  Tiny, vestigal wings, obviously meant for nothing other
than appearance, stretch out from the creature's back, membraneous like the
wings of a bat.  The creature stands only about five feet tall, rather a runt
by demonic standards.  What it lacks in sheer height, however, it appears to
have made up for those deficiencies in pure power and battle-cunning.  Long,
razor-sharp talons protrude from the creatures hands as well as its feet, dark
and dangerous.  A long, spiked tail constantly lashes from side to side, as if
seeking to deal injuries to any foolish enough to provoke the demon's wrath.
"
"Zithuan"
""
