""
""
"regard their surroundings with looks of contempt."
"This sinister-looking illithid regards you through a pair of large, milky
white eyes.  The eyes are framed just above a cone-like nose and five or six
foot-long tentacles that spiral downward across 180 degrees.  One of its
sinewy arms extends forward, while the other is folded to its head as its
pointy nails scratch against it in deep cogitation.  Its skin is a green-mauve
color and is thick and rubbery.  The creature only stands about six feet tall,
but its gaze and posture as it levitates above the ground make it appear
taller than it actually is.
"
"Olah"
