"Snow-White Roc"
""
""
"are here"
"Greatest avian predator in the northern wastes, the roc is a creature of
conflicting myths and of much debate.  Roughly twenty meters in height, its
wingspan easily stretches a full forty meters from wingtip to wingtip.  This
great bird closely resembles a snow-white eagle.  Her beak darkens in color
from snow white towards the head to a dirty gray at the sharply hooked tip. 
Wings, body, and head are a bold snow-white in color, with increased gray
speckling in her plumage towards the giant talons.  Even the bright eyes of
this bird blend in with the snow; only the pale ice-green irises do not fit
the wintry setting.  Mother rocs are notoriously fierce about defending their
nests; this is one of few creatures that even a mature dragon would hesitate
to attack.
"
"Nereus"
""
""
