"gazes at you solemnly."
"ghost of a fallen paladin"
""
""
"gazes at you solemnly."
"Dressed in shining plate armor, the spectral knight's vibrant image is
wreathed in radiant light that illuminates his present surroundings.  Numerous
strands of long, golden hair spill out from undearneath the ghost's helm,
while two deep-blue eyes regard those around him with an unearthly stare that
pierces deep into one's soul.  Even though his once strong and muscular body
has long since been lost to him, his ethereal form appears to waver in and out
of reality, still capable of inflicting very real harm upon any who would
challenge him.  Hefted easily by his left arm, a magnificent @Ygolden shield@n
sparkles as brightly as its possessor.
"
"Zithuan"
""
