"mountain bear"
""
"rugged"
"prowls the winter landscape, searching for prey."
"mountain bears"
""
"rugged"
"roar their displeasure."
"Roughly the size of a full-grown elephant, this great, white-furred bear is at
the top of the wintry food chain.  Coarse, white fur covers this creature's
entire body; even covered in ice and snow, this bear is probably quite warm. 
Thick, yellowed teeth protrude from the powerful jaws of this mighty predator,
capable of tearing a yeti to pieces.  This male bear's claws are equally
deadly weapons; they stretch perhaps eight inches from their tip until they
are buried under thick white fur.  On close examination, something appears
somehow wrong with this naturally normal animal: black blood has stained the
fur from jowls to chest, and its eyes seem tormented with an unnatural hunger.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
"if( 1d6 == 1 )
  interpret( mob, \"emote roars in rage, foam flying from his mouth!\" );
i = 0;
if( attack( mob, victim, 7d11+21, \"savage clawing\" ) )
  i = i + 1;
if( attack( mob, victim, 7d11+21, \"savage clawing\" ) )
  i = i + 1;
if( i == 2 ) {
  act_tochar( #hug, victim );
  act_notchar( #hugs, victim );
  i = 12d6+60;
  dam_message( victim, i, \"the hug of a mountain bear\" );
  inflict( victim, mob, i, \"the hug of a mountain bear\" );
  if( !victim )
    end;
  if( is_standing( victim ) || 1d4 == 1 )
    set_delay( victim, 32 );
}
attack( mob, victim, 8d16+40, \"ferocious bite\" );
if( 1d5 == 2 ) {
  rch = rand_char( room );
  if( rch == mob )
    rch = rand_player( room );
  if( rch ) {
    if( is_player( rch ) || is_pet( rch ) ) {
      act_tochar( #charge, rch );
      act_notchar( #charges, rch );
      if( attack( mob, rch, 6d20+35, \"unstoppable charge\" ) ) {
        if( rch && mob ) {
          if( size( rch ) <= size( mob ) ) {
            if( find_stat( rch, dex ) < random( 4, 20 ) ) {
              if( is_standing( rch ) ) {
                act_tochar( #knock, rch );
                act_notchar( #knockshim, rch );
                set_resting( rch );
                set_delay( rch, 52 - find_stat( rch, dex ) );
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
"
