"snow-white leopard"
""
""
"stands here majestically, overlooking his territory."
"snow-white leopards"
""
""
"stand here majestically, overlooking their territory."
"Covered in light-grey spots rimmed with a hint of black, the pure-white snow
leopard blends into any arctic environment.  His short, rounded ears with
black tips swivel freely, scanning the area for sounds of danger or prey in
which to stalk.  Eyes of mottled amber peer alertly about his surroundings,
ever vigilant and wary of all that is going on.  Twitching occasionally with
anticipation, or possibly agitation, the sinuous cat's tail is long and bushy,
thickly covered in soft, white fur with black rings.  Heavily muscled legs end
in massive furred paws which conceal coal-black, razor-sharp claws that are
capable of shredding flesh from bone with one swipe.
"
"Sirion"
""
"Severus"
