""
"appear quite bored together."
"Staring in total apathy about the landscape, this slender goblin plucks with a
total lack of rhythm at his bowstring, with a barely audible *twang*.  This
rumpled green archer looks very dirty, and smells the same.  His arms have
very well developed muscles.  His eyes appear very keen and sharp, indicating
he is probably good at his job.
"
"Soren"
""
""
