"Jushan"
""
"human sculptor"
""
""
"chips away at the smaller statue."
"human sculptors"
""
""
"chip away together at the smaller statue."
"Covered in tiny flakes of stone, this man just *looks* meticulous, which
reflects in his work.  Many hours of work have given Jushan's large hands a
layer of rough calluses, yet the precision and speed that he carves the
stonework belies any thought of clumsiness.  Concentration has etched deep,
focus lines on his face, and his gaze reflects that of a jaded man.
"
"Soren"
""
"Talis"
