"Nevbo"
""
"dwarven sculptor"
""
"portly"
"stands here admiring his handiwork."
"dwarven sculptors-"
""
""
"stand here confused by each others presence."
"Young and twitching with joy of his work, this portly dwarf is unusually giddy
for a place of such foreboading sadness.  Still young for his race, his
natural talent is obvious, and he surely knows it.  His arms are wiry and
strong, an odd juxtaposition so close to his quivering potbelly.  He looks to
be very at peace, oddly.
"
"Soren"
""
""
