""
""
"swings his weapon about, hitting anything that gets in his way."
"ogre foot soldiers"
""
""
"stand here, looking as if they are about to fight each other."
"Bruises, whip marks, and blistering burns, both dark scars and still
bleeding wounds, cover this ogre's body from head to toe.  As he swings
his weapon about in crazy arcs, it often collides painfully with his own
body.  He doesn't seem to notice these collisions, and you suspect that
this ogre has been hardened to pain, both through physical confrontation
and absolute religious fanaticism.  His cultist markings, deep and
repeatedly applied to the skin in multiple painful locations prove this
incredible loyalty.
"
"Soren"
""
