"Staring straight ahead, the blackened, dark eyes of this troll never waver
from his duty.  Toughened to better fulfill his task, he stands proudly and
with a total lack of doubt as to his true purpose.  Multiple tattoos and
precise markings on his diseased, green skin prove his loyalty to the cult,
and woe to any who try and make him fail in his protection of cult secrets
from unbelievers.
