"Peghod"
""
"dwarven architect"
""
""
"stands here, his fingers twirling in his beard."
"dwarven architects"
""
""
"stand here, their fingers twirling in their beard."
"This dwarven male stands a little over four feet tall, pretty average, except
he is hardly what one would consider plump.  He has well-defined muscles that
buldge out ostentatiously.  His sinewy legs are almost out of proportion with
his body, but that is not very uncommon for dwarves.  His beard is jet-black
and hangs in a tangled mass half-way down his body, where it comes together
inside a silver ring.  His mustache is just as dark, and curls ever so
slightly as it extends out past his lips.
"
"Soren"
""
""
"if( wearing_obj( 181, mob ) )
