""
""
"lightning elemental"
""
""
"crackles and sparks waiting for a command from its master."
"lightning elementals"
""
""
"crackle and spark waiting for a command from their master."
"Dancing and swirling, a cloud of pure electricty takes on a roughly humanoid
shape.  It's body only visible due to the sheer amount of energy harnessed in
its creation.  While not truly be able to distinguish a physical form, one can
make out an ethereal torso, arms, and head.  Sparks continually leap off from
this creation as the energies used to sustain this entity flow around it.
"
