"Standing before you is a young human boy, no older than ten summers.  He
stands at a height of four foot six and weighs nearly ninety five pounds,
seemingly proof that he has grown up always with a full plate.  His
bright blue eyes stare out at you, perched atop slightly chubby cheeks.
A slight blush is evident either you caught him doing something hes not
supposed to or he is impressed by something.  His blonde hair is neatly
cut at a very short length, worn tight against his head and cropped above
his ears.
"
"Soren"
