"attractive"
"stands here, an impish smile evident."
"vyan girls"
""
""
"stand here, smiling impishly."
"While hard to ascertain this young vyaness's age, she appears to have not yet
matured to full womanhood, placing her about equivalent to a twelve year old
human girl.  She stands at a height of just under five foot, while slight of
build she still seems to move with an almost dancer like quality.  Golden
blonde hair, slightly wavy, cascades down her back stopping just shy of the
tops of her legs.  Contrasting with her bright hair, her unblemished skin is
the color of a smooth light ebony.  Her face shows all the excitement of
childhood, from her large, slightly almond shaped eyes to the impish grin that
seems to always be prevalant.
"
"Soren"
""
