"Towering at least ten feet into the air, this troll has an evil sneer on his
face.  His body is huge, appearing to be all muscle.  Ripples of sinew twist
around every corner of him.  His body looks rock-hard, his muscles seeming in
perfect form.  Deep scarrings on his upper-arms and body indicate he has
probably been hardened by the roughs of battle.  His body reflects a deep
green color, with a face of a darker hue, and messy black hair.
"
