""
"stare blankly, awaiting new orders from their master."
"This grotesque looking beast is easily identified as a horrid misuse of
magical powers.  While difficult to ascertain where one magical
manipulation began and another left off, you are able to tell that the
beast, while living must have once resembled a grizzly bear in the body.
Its head though, had been trasnformed into a longer, almost dog like
snout.  If this were not bad enough, the creature appears to have been
raised from the dead.  Remnants of its skin hang in tattered shreds,
still sporting open and festering wounds.  Sharp, gleaming teeth still
peek out from its massive jaws, while razor-like claws appear to have
lost none of their sharpness in death.
"
"Soren"
""
""
