#2405
"Zendair"
""
"shadow invoker, mageling of Temohpab"
""
""
"stands here, calling forth the power of darkness."
"shadow invoker's, magelings of Temophab"
""
""
"stand here, combining their spells."
"Dark and deadly looking, this man before you does not appear to be wholly
human.  No one trait stands out as alien, but instead its more of a
feeling one has while gazing upon him.  His eyes are a dark green in
color, shadowed by his locks of stringy, oily brown hair.  The muscles in
his arms are stretched tight and sinewy, perhaps proof that this man has
not been around books his entire life.  He stands nearly six and a half
feet tall and weighs nearly two hundred pounds, certainly a fine physical
specimen.  Shadows seem to constantly writhe on and around his tanned
skin, almost as if they were part of his form rather than some trick
played by the light.
"
"Soren"
""
"Nereus"
"mob = mob_in_room( 2405, room );
attack( mob, ch, 2d5+90, \"brutal pounding\" );
do_spell( prismic missile, mob, ch );
if( random( 1, 7 ) == 5 ) {
  i = 2d50+100;
  act_room( #gone, ch );
  act_tochar( #rockemsockem, ch );
  act_notchar( #rockem2, ch );
  dam_message( ch, i, \"The shadow choke\" );
  inflict( ch, mob, i, \"Zendair\" );
  }
if( random( 1, 6 ) == 1 ) {
  act_room( #buhbye, ch );
  loop( all_in_room ) {
    if( rch != mob )
      do_spell( blind, mob, rch );
    }
  }
if( random( 1, 10 ) == 3 ) {
  act_tochar( #fire, ch );
  act_notchar( #fire2, ch );
  do_spell( faerie fire, mob, ch );
  }
if( random( 1, 10 )  == 4 ) {
  act_tochar( #scary, ch );
  act_notchar( #scary2, ch );
  do_spell( fear, mob, ch );
  }
if( random( 1, 10 ) == 2 ) {
  if( has_obj( 1006, mob ) ) {
    act_room( #scroll, ch );
    interpret( mob, \"recite scroll\" );
    }
  }
if( random( 1, 10 ) == 9 ) {
  if( has_obj( 1007, mob ) ) {
    act_room( #scroll, ch );
    interpret( mob, \"recite scroll\" );
    }
  }
