"drooling"
"drip acid on the floor."
"This demonic entity looks like many of his brethren around the world, a
twisted canine form desecrated by the powers of evil.  The creature stands
four feet high at the shoulder, covered in matted, yellow fur.  Small patches
of blackened scorch marks cover it's body, giving it a diseased and festering
appearance.  Yellow, glowing orbs pass themselves off as eyes, and large fangs
jut from the beasts mouth.  Acid dripping from its incisors causes a slight
hissing noise as it strikes the ground.
"
"Soren"
""
""
