""
"patrol the town proper."
"Ever vigilant even in these years past the prime of his life, this man has
remained loyal to the the town guard through all the battles that have raged
through the city in the past.  He stands at a height of five feet eight inches
tall and appears to have gained a slight gut in his older years, topping the
scales at over two hundred pounds.  A faint scar on the right side of his face
trails from beside his eyebrow, along his cheekbone, and down to his chin. 
Warm blue eyes lend an impression of youth to his face, though his hair has
lost most of its darkness and instead is a light shade of gray that gives him
a more distinguished look.
"
"Soren"
""
