met, there was hardly any fun in her life...  she had been chosen and she bore
the burden well.  Few could be given such a title as the Spiritual Hammer and
not have it be some sort of joke, for indeed that was exactly what she was... 
vengeance and retribution incarnate.  Though do not get me wrong, she was not
spiteful, nor overly violent, nor even necessarily sad...  she just was. 
