"This remarkable specimen of dragon kind fills nearly the entirety of the
remaining room, its tail even rests atop the massive oaken bed.  Midnight
black scales glimmer slightly in the soft white light filling the room from
the aging mage-globe; not a single of her remarkably large scales shows even a
nic or scratch.  The dragon certainly appears to be fully grown, though she
does not appear to be ancient nor slow or weak from age.  Instead rippling
muscles pulse from beneath the scales, while her eyes survey the entirety of
the room looking for any to call prey.  Her dark wings are pulled tight
against her body, the room being far too small to possibly allow her to
stretch her wings to their full length.
"
"Soren"
