lean and muscular, though it is evident that once he was much more.  A shock
of wild, grey hair is loosely kept back in a ponytail, matching his few days
of stubbly grey beard growth.  A handspan less than six feet tall, he stands
proudly, his movements graceful and confident.  Ancient eyes, haggard and
sleepless, stare from a face lined with worry.
"
