them wantonly, imperiling their very existence, merely to sell their feathers
as souvenirs.  Find him, end his wanton slaughter of the good jays jays, and
return clear proof of his demise to me.@n
"
E
"holy_symbol"
"@GDo this, and I will reward you with a symbol holy to the Lady of the Forest.@n
"
E
"reward_follower"
"@GDo this and, though you have no need of a holy symbol of Cynnis, I will
still reward you for your valiant efforts.@n
"
E
"reward_other"
"@GDo this and, though you have no need of a holy symbol of Cynnis, I will
still reward you in some other manner.@n
"
E
"rreward"
"@GYou have no need for Her holy symbol.  Do this task, however, and I may yet
reward you with something.@n
"
E
"secomber"
"@GAlas, he is a citizen of Medienne so I fear this will not endear you to them
overly much.  Still, with some effort you should be able to repair any harm
this does to your reputation with them if you feel the need to concern
yourself with the beliefs of those who hunt for sport rather than out of need.@n
"
E
"has_symbol"
"The priestess says, \"@GAh, but I see you already have a holy symbol of Cynnis,
$n, and do not need another just now.@n\"
"
E
"thief"
"The priestess glares at you.  \"@GAnd what are you, who have no right to bear
the Lady of Life's holy symbol, doing with one of them?@n\" So saying, she
quickly snatches it away from you.
"
E
"rthief"
"The priestess glares at $n.  \"@GAnd what are you, who have no right to bear
the Lady of Life's holy symbol, doing with one of them?@n\" So saying, she
quickly snatches the holy symbol away from $n.
"
