""
""
"stands stationary, barely moving a hair."
"three-toed sloths"
""
""
"stand stationary, barely moving a hair."
"This large mammal's fur is pale about its stomach but dark along its back, the
darker parts being varrying shades of dark green.  Its black face is oddly
small for is long arms and body and it is difficult to tell whether its black
eyes are open or not.  Its hands and feet each have three toes for climbing
and holding onto trees.  This sloth is an extremely slow moving creature, only
when it breaths can you be certain that it really is alive.
"
"Zithuan"
""
""
"attack( mob, victim, 4d10+30, \"heavy-pawed swipe\" );
if( random( 0, 5 ) == 1 ) {
  mpcode( mob, 1 );
  do_spell( sleep, null, mob, 5 );
  }
"
