""
""
"vampire bat"
""
"small, brown-furred"
"flies about the area."
"vampire bat"
""
"small, brown-furred"
"fly about the area."
"Barely larger than a common mouse, this winged rodent nonetheless is an
intimidating sight.  Vicious, wedge-shaped incisors that appear much too large
for such a small mouth indicate how it earned its name.  The faint spots of
blood dribbling down its tiny chin further confirm the diet of this otherwise
harmless looking bat.
"
"Zithuan"
""
""
"attack( mob, victim, 1d6, \"small claw\" );
attack( mob, victim, 1d6, \"small claw\" );
if( attack( mob, victim, 3d6, \"piercing bite\" ) ) {
  if( random( 1, 3 ) == 1 ) {
    act_tochar( #suck, ch );
    act_notchar( #rsuck, ch );
    drain_stat( victim, con, 1, -1 );
    if( !is_player( victim ) ) {
      i = find_stat( victim, level );
      inflict( victim, mob, i/2, \"vampire bat\" );
      }
    }
  }
"
E
"suck"
"@rLatching on with its small bite, the vampire bat begins to drink your
blood!@n
"
E
"rsuck"
"@rLatching onto $n with its small bite, the vampire bat begins to drink $s
blood!@n
"
