"The back of this large eagle is covered with feathers so black they look blue
and the underside overed in white.  Its wingspan is seven feet and its claws
are enormous to ensnare prey as well as perching.  Its double crested head is
pale gray with piercing black eyes.
"
"Zithuan"
""
""
"i = 0;
if( attack( mob, victim, 4d12+16, \"sharp talon\" ) )
  i = i + 1;
if( attack( mob, victim, 4d12+16, \"sharp talon\" ) )
  i = i + 1;
if( random( 0, i ) == 2 ) {
  act_tochar( #grab, ch );
  act_notchar( #rgrab, ch );
  i = 5d10+30;
  inflict( victim, mob, i, \"harpy eagle\" );
  dam_message( victim, i, \"A harpy eagle's devastating beak\" );
  }
else
  attack( mob, victim, 5d10+30, \"powerful beak\" );
"
