"A long, scaleless fish of dull gray-brown color, this serpantine eel resembles
a large aquatic snake.  A thin head filled with tiny, sharp teeth is at one
end of this eight foot long fish, and the tail end has barely any fins for
navigation.  Surrounding this bizarre creature is an almost visible field of
electricity that every so often flashes in bright bursts.
"
"Zithuan"
""
