"\"Beavers live along the river that runs through Medienne Forest, but you won't
find many out in the open.  Any who intend to make a trade of beaver pelts
should search for the entrance to the big beaver dam.  When I was a young
hunter, they built their home under the bridge near the Medienne City, so
perhaps you should start looking there.\"
