"tame"
"\"So you're looking to learn how to charm the woodland creatures?  I know of
two places where the talent can be gained.  One is to the north, where the
forest has become as aware as you or I - perhaps more.  If you wish to go
there, I suggest you seek out the forest ranger, for he will know better than
I how to gain the aid of that strange folk.\"
"
E
"tame2"
"\"The other teacher lives somewhere in the swamplands far to the south.  There
live beasts unfamiliar to me, so I do not know the danger of that road.  Be
careful where you step, though, for the ground can turn against you.\"
"
