"ranger"
"\"The forest ranger is a solitary sort, wandering the forest freely, and the
woodland creatures are peaceful to him.  He may be difficult to find, but that
is simply his travelling nature, not any intent to hide.  Unless you are
unnaturally brave or foolish, I suggest you keep to this side of the river and
be wary of the stranger parts of the forest.  If he has travelled there, it
may be wiser to wait for his return to the safer parts of the forest.\"
