tends to his wares behind the counter.  His thick, coarse black hair partially
covers up the various warts along his ruddy face.  Partially chipped tusks
rise half a foot across this orc's crooked mouth.  As his small, beady eyes
occasionally meet yours, they narrow even further, carefully examining your
every move.
"
"Olah"
""
""
