"Rail thin with his bones almost visible, Lewcitair calmly tends to his shop. 
The vyan's angular face becomes markedly pointed as it reaches its lower
point, his chin.  The pointy chin becomes even more exaggerated whenever his
mouth opens to reveal sparkling white teeth.  Thin strands of silvery hair
rest against his narrow shoulders that protrude into a V-shaped angle.  His
frail body looks like it will barely hold together, yet his movements are
fluid and confident.
"
"Olah"
