toward the heavens.  His wings are spread outward a bit, curving around him
adorned with colors of many kinds.  His legs look just as a hawks would,
however, they are much larger in size, and built into tightly packed muscle
tissue.  His claws spread outward to the floor.  Combined with the sheer
muscle, they might be able to rip through a large tree.
