"young winter wolf"
""
""
"waits for his mother's return."
"young winter wolf"
""
""
"wait for their mother's return."
"Smaller than his adult counterparts, this wolf stands probably four feet at
the shoulder; still larger than any hound or mastiff counterpart.  Bleak,
blue-white eyes watch suspiciously from above a snow-white muzzle.  A
frost-pink tongue lolls from this creature's mouth, sharp canines at the
ready.  The wolf's coat is thick and shaggy, bright white in color everywhere
except at the tip of the tail, tips of the ears, and the underbelly, where it
is a soft grey-blue in color.  This wolf is still young enough that it should
not be left alone -- perhaps either something has befallen his mother or her
return is imminent.
"
"Nereus"
""
