"Broad, powerful wings that resemble a giant eagle's extend from the muscular
body of this noble-looking creature.  His golden-brown body is that of a large
lion's with its taut, furry legs that end in razor sharp paws.  A thick mane
completely surrounds his neck and stern-looking face which looks like an adult
male human.  His eyebrows seem fixed at a downward angle, as though surveying
everything around him with careful consideration.
"
"Olah"
