""
"muscular, broad-shouldered"
"stands at his post."
"{male ice trolls} ice troll warriors"
""
"muscular, broad-shouldered"
"guard their village from intruders."
"Standing almost seven and a half feet tall, this muscular troll looks to be
one of the warriors of this small village.  This troll's skin is a mottled,
rubbery grey in color, and mostly hairless.  Occasionally, the skin is broken
with what is obviously a claw or tooth scar; apparently life in the northern
mountains involves no small level of personal risk.  A shock of pure white
hair stands atop the troll's head, swept back and standing straight up. 
Black, beady eyes survey the area, and although obviously bored, this troll is
probably at least dimly aware of what is going on around him.
"
"Nereus"
""
