""
"stand here in a morbid, undead pack."
"Once a bright and vibrant blue, the eyes of this proud wolf have faded and
died from within, the spark of life gone.  Now, a mindless gaze wanders this
undead wolf's surroundings, watching for flesh to eat.  Matted white fur has
began to decay, revealing patches of muscle and the white of bone beneath. 
The ears of this wolf are tattered and bloody, evidence of its final, fatal
struggle to remain alive.  While the teeth have dulled, blackened, and some
are missing, this creature's bite is probably still powerful enough to kill.
"
"Nereus"
