"Bright, blue spots of light from this wolf skeleton's eyes seem to bore into
your soul.  A feeling of great sadness and pride long since dissolved are
visible when you look upon this abomination.  The bones of this animated
skeleton have been bleached white, as if by sun, the scouring of sand, or
acid.  The wolf's tail has been broken off or was not part of the animation
process -- since its reanimation, it has been lost.
"
