"{snow cat cubs} very young angarlishes"
""
""
"are chained together to prevent their escape."
"Still as large as an enormous lion, this very young angarlish is merely a
quarter of the weight of its parent.  However, even young, it is evident that
this is no natural animal; a deep, unyielding hunger is obvious in the
glinting, sickly yellow pupils of this young cat.  It appears to have been
extremely poorly treated by its original captors, with bruises and old breaks
obvious along the length of its body.  Already almost six inches in length,
large, bleach-white sabre teeth protrude from the upper jaw of the angarlish. 
The creature's jaws are still young with fat and its claws still soft and
growing - it will be long before this creature grows into the well-muscled
killing machine that it has the potential to be.
"
"Nereus"
""
""
