""
""
"- Please contact an immortal!"
"Once this old troll was probably one of the larger, more muscular warriors of
the settlement, but now muscle has turned to fat or melted away with age. 
Stooping more than even the average troll, this old troll doesn't even reach
six and a half feet tall.  His skin is a faded, rubbery grey in color, but
tinged blue in patches on his chest and back, perhaps a sign of old age, or
just the natural coloration of this troll.  A shock of coarse, grey-white hair
stands atop his head, swept back and standing straight up.  Despite his age,
his hands still appear strong, and it is likely that if he could not pull his
weight the trollish community would certainly kill him; the old troll must
still be fairly fit.
"
"Nereus"
""
""
