with thickly muscled arms, legs and torso, obviously accustomed to strenuous
labor and well-suited to it.  Several scars cross the thick skin stretched
taut over those muscles.  In spite of the hard lifestyle that has befallen
this ent, either by choice or luck, he still wears a jovial expression on his
face, taking joy in his work.
