"This is quite likely the oldest ent you have ever seen.  He is so old that his
large eyes are milky with age with thick folds of greying skin drooping
beneath them.  Much like the folds of skin under his eyes, the rest of his
skin is an ashen grey with deep, thick wrinkles etching almost every inch of
it.  The sparse remains of hair and a bristly beard fleck his aging head with
tufts of white that are almost lost in the paling tone of his skin.  In spite
of the age that seems to dominate this elderly member of his race, there is a
definite spark of intelligence still in his milky eyes.
"
"Talis"
""
