"advice"
"I explored the lands for many years before retiring here.  I might be able to
give you some useful @badvice@n.  If you are interested you can ask me for it
by typing 'ask ent advice'.
"
E
"advice2"
"There are quite a few helpfiles which you might want to read and a few have
been written for new players such as yourself.  You might consider starting
with @bhelp newbie@n.  Otherwise, there is an orc logging camp nearby, north
of the Altar to Cynnis that would be a good starting place for you to hunt. 
You may want to visit some of the trainers here on Ent'Moot first to enhance
your skills before you leave.
"
