"ents"
"The race of ents on The Forests Edge are not the treants of popular fantasy. 
Ents are rather more like \"good\" trolls who's focus on life isn't in killing
and destroying but on preserving the natural land.  You can find specific
details about them in the help files by typing @bhelp ents@n.
"
E
"ents2"
"One thing that you will need to know about your race is that, while other
races may eat meat, ents may not.  As the wardens of nature, ents may only eat
the plants of the land.  There are many bushes on Ent'Moot from which you may
pick fruit when it is ripe.  You simple need to type \"pick fruit bush\" to
pick the fruit.  Once out in the rest of the realm you will have to seek out
other bushes or find other sources of vegetable to eat.
"
