"cleric"
"Ah, I see you have chosen to study the path of divine worship.  There is a
priestess of Cynnis who can teach you the basics of clerical magic.  Her name
is Chaoriesh and she can be find at Cynnis's altar a short ways due east of
here.  Just keep going east and you'll eventually come to her.
"
E
"mage"
"Ah, I see you have chosen to study the path of arcane studies.  There is a
practitioner of such magics very near here who can teach you the basics. 
Myshuel, the teacher of magics, can be found just north and west of here.
"
E
"bard"
"Alas, I see you have chosen to pursue the arts of musical study. 
Unfortunately, there are no ent bards currently living upon fair Ent'Moot and
those songs we here know are suited more to the healing of the land than the
stirring of mortal spirits.  Fortunately, a bard may learn a little of a
mage's craft as well and there is a practitioner of arcane magic just north
and west of here who can teach you the basics for learning such mage craft.
"
E
"ranger"
"Ah, I see you have chosen to study the path of protection over the woods. 
Such magic as you will learn is to be found in various places about the land,
however, there is a priestess of Cynnis a short ways to the east of here by
the name of Chaoriesh who can teach you some of the most basic spells you will
be able to learn following that path.
"
E
"paladin"
"Ah I see you have chosen to follow the path of the holy protector, defending
your faith with weapons as well as magic.  While you will learn weaponcraft
before you learn your divine spells, when you are ready to learn the magic of
your faith, you will find a priestess of Cynnis some ways east of here named
Chaoriesh.  Chaoriesh can teach you the basics of priestly spells that you may
be able to lean when you are ready.
"
!
