"A majestic creature of wintry beauty, this woman stands proudly before you. 
Though her alluring visage suggests youth, her height and haughty stature make
her a rather imposing figure.  Her skin is white - not merely pale, but white
like the freshly fallen snow, except for her very red mouth, the lips of which
are set firmly together.  Eyes the color of water beneath the frosty shell of
ice on a pond gaze coldly upon you from a face with aristocratic features -
lovely, yet stern.  Hair like spun sugar flows freely down to her waist, not a
strand out of order.  The purest white furs of the softest animals are draped
over her robes that shine like satin, embossed with silvery runes.
"
