"This monstrous being of ice appears to have been crudely carved or shaped by
magic from a single, massive monolith of opaque, blue-white ice.  Over twenty
feet in height and probably half as wide, this creature leaves deep
indentations in the ground when it walks; it probably weighs at least several
tons.  Formed in the shape of an immensely muscular, impossibly proportioned
man, its legs and arms are as thick as ancient oaks and seem as impregnable to
harm.  Obvious scars from weapons and scorch marks are evident across this
construct's torso, but they seem to be merely superficial damage accumulated
over eons of guarding this place from intruders.
"
"Nereus"
