and is covered in soft, flexible scales from head to tail.  A whip-like tail
thrashes constantly behind powerfully built rear legs, moving sinously as it
searches for prey.  Two tiny claws twitch sharply, hanging down to the beast's
knees and tipped with six needle-sharp, ripping claws.  Slitted, gold cat eyes
gleam, a hunger and animal cunning evident in their malevolent gaze.  Beneath
the golden orbs, a wide, black-stained maw waits, where row after row of
needle-sharp teeth drip with ichor.
"
