""
"striking, blonde"
"try to stay hidden behind the ancient trees."
"The curvaceous figure of a female fey possessing striking beauty appears
before you in a seductive pose.  Luxuriant locks of glistening, golden hair
flow down her smooth, delicate head and rest on her shoulders and bosom.  Her
face is thin but perfectly formed with deep hazel eyes, high cheek bones, and
heart-shaped lips.  Her skin looks silky smooth and tanned throughout.  Long
shapely legs provide her with a graceful stance, while her toned arms move
with the elegance of a dancer.
"
"Olah"
""
"Olah"
