through royal blue eyes.  A trimmed beard lines the bottom third of his
chiseled face.  His skin is tanned throughout and perfectly smooth yet toned.
His broad shoulders and muscular arms are poised as though ready for anything.
Tightly muscled legs are positioned in a sturdy, authoritative stance.  Not an
ounce of fat is visible on any part of his body.
"
