"This proud-looking man stands about twenty-five feet tall and is extremely
well built.  His muscles ripple along his chest.  Powerful arms the size of a
tree trunk extend from his broad shoulders.  A brand in the shape of a circle
with a thunder symbol inside of it can be seen on his muscular arms.  It is
the only visible blemish on his otherwise smooth, tanned skin.  His royal blue
eyes appear vacant, as though pondering something deeply, and are set above a
finely chiseled nose and cheeks.  A perfectly trimmed beard completes the
lower part of his face.
"
"Olah"
""
"Olah"
