"This massive redwood tree towers high into the air, piercing the sky for an
undiscernible height.  A multitude of thick branches splay from its fibrous
trunk that stretches out for many yards.  Large, spiny leaves blanket the
branches and provide a grand shade for the ground below.  Its bark is rough
and aged with deep creases, denoting that this tree has lived for many years. 
Ten feet up from its roots are a pair of round eyes and a long, horizontal
slit that could be its mouth.
"
"Olah"
""
"Olah"
