"ancient green dragons"
""
""
"wait upon their bed of coins, unconcerned with the passage of time."
"The large green scales of this immense dragon reflect light abnormally, as
though shifting the patterns with each breath the dragon takes.  The scales
cover most of her gigantic body except an area near her hind legs, where a
long scar has formed.  Retracted by her sides are a pair of wings that span at
least fifty feet when fully extended.  Her sharp claws are curled and are big
enough to grasp and crush a grizzly bear.  Smoke rises from her nose and
dissipates near her fiery red eyes.  A massive tail that stretches over
fifteen feet coils menacingly, as though ready to lash out at her enemies.
"
"Olah"
""
