eyes are pitch black and narrow, constantly surveying its surroundings.  Its
tongues stick out of each of its mouths, and drool rolls off each tongue and
sharp tooth.  Its movements are quick and graceful as it circles the area
around this part of the cavern.  Wagging rapidly from side to side is a
single, furry tail that seems to give off a fiery red glow.
