appear taller.  A pair of bushy eyebrows are angled downward as his narrow
slits for eyes gaze out suspiciously.  Crow's feet beside his eyes and several
forehead wrinkles make him appear prematurely aged.  Although his body is
skinny, his musculature isn't frail but rather tightly defined.  His knees,
however, are bent and face one another at a 45 degree angle, making his stance
appear wobbly and unsure.
"
