""
"- Contact an immortal!"
"Probably in his early fifties, this ice troll is truly ancient for his race. 
Folds of loose, baggy skin cover his rubbery grey body, which has faded in his
age to a shade of blue-grey.  This old troll's hair has thinned, but his pate
is still covered with a shock of starkly white hair, swept back and standing
straight up atop his head.  His eyes constantly open and close, clouded over
and oblivious to his surroundings.  He appears almost skeletally thin; his
ribs are clearly visible through his rubbery skin.  This troll must either
have some unknown ability or be held in high regard by the trolls of this
mountain, since otherwise he would have been killed and eaten long ago.
"
"Nereus"
""
