""
""
"- contact an immortal!"
"This aged female ice troll is immediately discernable to be possessed of
something unusual in the rest of this ice troll village -- a cruel, unyielding
gaze of cunning and power.  She is of indeterminate age, although clearly
ancient, even for a longer-lived race such as a human.  Cold, ice blue eyes
peer knowingly out from a wrinkled, emaciated face.  A few wisps of extremely
fine, white hair cover the top of her otherwise bald pate.  Her flesh hangs
like baggy clothes hanging over a man far too skinny; rubbery hide hangs
loosely from stick-thin arms and legs.
"
"Nereus"
