"are here"
"This hulking oaf of a troll stands over eight feet in height, and half as
wide.  Like the rest of his ilk, this ice troll's hide is a mottled, rubbery
grey and completely free of hair, save a shock of greasy, coarse white hair
that stands atop his head.  An enormous fang of some creature, nearly eight
inches in length, has been forced through the lobe of one of his ears, the
trollish flesh healing right around the fang and fusing it to the ear.  His
apparent dominant physical stature seems to have come at a cost; he seems only
marginally aware of what is happening around him.  His vapid, empty gaze
sweeps across the market, watching for disturbances; though it might take
quite a bit of a disturbance before it registered with this troll.
"
"Nereus"
