"This proud, noble steed is milky white throughout its entire muscular body. 
It observes the world through sapphire blue eyes.  Flowing gracefully down its
neck is a golden mane that is thick yet looks as soft as watered silk.  Large,
white-feathered wings extend midway from its body and reach over fifteen feet
long when fully stretched.  A bushy tail whose tip looks like it was dipped in
gold wags forcefully from its hind section.  Supporting its body are four
toned legs that end in hooves that look so unblemished that they probably
rarely touch the ground.
"
"Olah"
