"The decrepit-looking skeleton of a massive creature with a plated skull
lurches nearby.  Its skull is shaped like a shark's head, and worms can be
seen crawling out from its hollow eye sockets.  Rotten flesh still clings to
its spine, which looks twice as thick as an elephant's tusk.  The spine
extends almost thirty feet long, ending at the tip of its tailbone.  The claws
at the end of its bony feet are covered in blood splotches.
