"The curvaceous figure of a female fey possessing striking beauty appears
before you in a seductive pose.  Luxuriant locks of glistening, raven-black
hair flow down her smooth, delicate head and rest on her shoulders and bosom. 
Her face is thin but perfectly formed with deep hazel eyes, high cheek bones,
and heart-shaped lips.  Her skin looks silky smooth and tanned throughout. 
Long shapely legs provide her with a graceful stance, while her toned arms
move with the elegance of a dancer.
"
"Olah"
