Knights.  Though aging, he still appears fit and ready for combat.  His white
hair, what remains of it at least, is cut short like that on most of his
companions.  His bushy white eyebrows are large enough that they almost seem
to be trying to make up for his lack of hair.  His clothes are more or less
neat, although, a stray straw or two still clings to his leggings and they
smell largely of the hay and horses Osric deals with.
"
