"An exceptional specimen of a human being, this Knight displays bulging muscles
attained through many long hours of combat both in training and the field. 
Shifting his weight as he looks about, you see he moves with an easy grace
that belies his heavy frame.  Unlike most of his companions who bear
short-cropped hair, this Knight's straight onyx hair is long enough to hang
down onto his shoulders.  An equally ebon mustache, although neatly trimmed,
droops down on either side of his mouth to hang just below his chin.  He is
fairly devoid of scars suggesting he must be a good fighter to have avoided
taking many scars in a career that ultimately placed him in charge of the
Medienne Knights.
"
"Talis"
""
"Hedrack"
