"tapestry1"
"The Knight glances at the tapestry then looks back to you and explains, \"@YAh,
the First Fallen.  Those six brave knights were the first of our Order that fell
in the defense of Medienne.  Many years back now, this is back when we humans
first came upon elves, there were misunderstandings, I guess you would say.@n\"
"
E
"tapestry2"
"The Knight continues, \"@YWell, things didn't go well and misunderstandings
turned to skirmishes and then very nearly to full scale war.  In the end, the
elves attacked Medienne.  Those six Knights gave their lives in defense of the
city on the first day of fighting.@n\"
"
E
"tapestry3"
"He finally ends, \"@YTime passed as it is wont to do and the humans and elves
patched their differences but not before losses on both sides.  It was long
ago, now, and I'm certainly glad of our current relations with the elves.  The
fighting was brutal and many good people were wounded and killed on both sides
merely for cultural differences.  I think both the humans and elves agree we
make much better allies then enemies these days.@n\"
"
E
"busy"
"The Knight Marshal looks you over and says to you, \"@YI see you have the
tabbard of a Knight but you are not yet a Knight.  Complete your tasks and,
once you have joined, I will answer your questions.@n\"
"
