"reptilian"
"{reptilian beast} tiphuzuad"
""
"large"
"is here, slavering jaws hungering for flesh."
"{reptilian beasts} tiphuzuad"
""
"large"
"stand in a pack, hunting for prey."
"A large, reptilian, bipedal creature, which stands more than a head taller
than an average man.  While it does not tower over a man, it makes up for this
deficiency in height with a lean, muscular frame and a long, whipping tail. 
From head to tail, it is covered in rock-like scales, as thick as a shingle of
slate on the shoulders, back, legs, and arms, but flexible and supple along
the joints.  A deep black, slime-covered ridge of wicked-looking barbs runs
the length of the creature's spine, starting at the base of the neck and
growing into lethal six inch barbs at the tip of the tail.  The beast's
powerful rear legs are complemented by slender, muscular forelimbs, both
tipped with six wicked, razor-like claws.  Slitted, cat-like eyes gleam a
cold, lifeless gold; a malevolent questing visible in their gaze.  Beneath the
glittering eyes, a wide, black-stained maw waits, more than a dozen rows of
triangular teeth waiting to consume their bearer's prey.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
