""
"Black-robed Priest of Xiroce"
""
""
"is chanting a devotion to his deity."
"Black-robed Priest of Xiroce"
""
""
"are chanting devotions to their deity."
"Thick, warm robes of unyielding black obscure the form of the priest within
the robes.  the priest even keeps his hands concealed within the dark robes. 
The only portion of the priest you can actually see is the frontal portion of
his face that isn't concealed by the deep cowl of the robe.  His skin is a
dusky grey and shows no lines of age.  His head, what you can see of it,
appears either clean-shaven or naturally hairless.  His eyes are a dark shade
of brown, almost black.
"
"Talis"
