"huge, burly trolls"
""
""
"sweat profusely from working at the forge."
"The gigantic smithing hammer seems tiny in this massive trolls hands.  Solid
black skin, covered in sweat, gleams in the light from the furnace.  Two
fingers of his left hand are missing, though it doesn't seem to slow him down
as he goes about his trade.  His beady eyes stare blankly, never blinking, and
seem to lack the intelligence required for the work he does so well.  The
muscles in his right arm are heavily built from hammering, while those in his
left are more toned fromt he finer work of handling the weapons, giving this
troll and unbalanced, awkward appearance.
"
"Olah"
""
