""
""
"stand by the forge working strenuously."
"Hunched over his work bench, the troll before you looks relativly young
compared to most trolls in the realm.  His skin is a dark green, nearing black
in the smokey air of the armour shop, and is strangly devoid of the warty
growths common to most of his race.  His beady, bright red red eyes seem quite
intelligent, and his long fingers appear extremly dextrous.  His only
noticeable scar is a nasty patch of burned skin along his left arm, probably
picked up during his training as a smith.
"
"Olah"
