""
"look over their tablets and scrolls, lost in thought."
"Silvery curls of hair adorn the top of the head of this male halfling.  Each
strand glitters against the crimson light that originates from above. 
Numerous wrinkles trace throughout the contours of his face.  Each crease in
his skin, particularly the crow's feet beside his turquoise blue eyes, are
deep and define his countenance with a sagely wisdom.  He stands just under
three feet tall as his posture is slightly stooped over, observing everything
in the room with quiet care.
"
"Olah"
