"Ysandra"
"skinned"
"honey-skinned Romani woman"
""
""
"peers warily from the shadows."
"honey-skinned Romani woman"
""
""
"peer warily from the shadows."
"A cap of short, raven's-wing curls, cut very nearly in the style of a young
boy, adorns this tall, graceful woman's head, though her hair is probably the
only thing about her that would ever look boyish.  Her figure is supple,
curvaceous and rippling with well-toned muscles that lend her every movement
the langorous grace of a dancer.  A single scar mars her otherwise flawless,
honey-colored skin, running the length of her right cheek.  In her eyes, their
color a blue so deep that sapphires should be envious of their hue, lingers a
cool, remote expression.
"
"Minqa"
