"are here"
"A fairly decent-sized coach large enough even for an ogre or ent to fit
inside.  Its exterior has been painted a solemn black and has been trimmed
with gold-colored paint.  On its doors is painted the words
\"@bMedienne-Chiiron Coach Service, 2 plat fee on entry@n\".  A heavily scarred
and dangerous-looking driver, dressed in ornate finery looking somewhat
unusual on him, sits perched on a seat on the coaches front holding the reigns
in one hand and a whip in the other.  A team of four black horses stands
before the coach pulling it wherever the driver leads them.
"
"Talis"
