"Standing an imposing six feet tall when slightly hunched over, this lizardman
crosses his muscular, scaly arms confidently.  His crimson red eyes gaze out
from narrow slits in all directions.  His scales are yellow and red and form a
cross-shaped pattern along his back and tail.  The smooth, thick scales
shimmer against the light, caused by the flinching from his enormous
protruding muscle.  It's as though he's ready to attack anyone daring to
intrude.
"
"Olah"
""
"Talis"
