""
"amalgamated"
"{amalgamated cluster of animated bones} bone horror"
""
""
"stands here, supported by dozens of legs."
"{amalgamated clusters of animated bones} bone horrors"
""
""
"are here"
"This horrifying monstrosity resembles a pile of bones of dozens of species --
bear, wolf, human, and even the bones of other, unidentifiable species make up
this moving cluster of bone.  A dozen heads adorn the top of this
elephant-sized creature, empty eye sockets blazing a bright crimson.  Beneath,
the body of this beast, a thousand intertwined femurs and ribs from
innumerable creatures rests, the visible bones scratched over time by unknown
combats over the ages.  Around the perimeter, reaching out towards living
flesh, skeletal arms stretch, some carrying weapons, others mere claws of
bone.  Beneath everything, supporting the behemoth of bone, dozens of legs,
some of bears to support the mighty weight, humanoid and otherwise helping to
provide stability.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
"loop( all_in_room ) {
  if( 1d3 != 2 ) {
    if( is_player( rch ) ) {
      i = find_stat( rch, align );
      if( i % 3 == 0 ) {
        if( class( rch ) != cleric && class( rch ) != paladin )
          do_spell( fear, mob, rch, 10 );
        }
      else
        do_spell( fear, mob, rch, 10 );
      }
    else if( is_pet( rch ) )
      do_spell( fear, mob, rch, 10 );
    }
  }
i = 0;
j = 1d16+8;
loop( i < j ) {
  rch = rand_player( room );
  if( 1d4 != 2 )
    attack_weapon( mob, rch, 2d4, \"skeletal hand\" );
  else {
    if( 1d3 != 2 )
      attack_offhand( mob, rch, 2d4, \"skeletal claw\" );
    else
      interpret( mob, \"disarm\", rch );
    }
  i = i + 1;
  }
i = 0;
j = 1d24+8;
loop( i < j ) {
  rch = rand_player( room );
  attack( mob, rch, 6d8+7, \"skeletal claw rake\" );
  i = i + 1;
  }
i = 1d3;
rch = rand_player( room );
attack( mob, rch, 5d23+33, \"fierce bite of a skeletal bear\" );
if( i < 3 )
  attack( mob, rch, 5d12+22, \"bite of a skeletal wolf\" );
if( i == 1 )
  attack( mob, rch, 6d20+35, \"bite of a skeletal bear\" );
"
