"stenwulf beefy bald man wild scraggly beard"
"beefy, bald man with a wild, scraggly beard"
""
""
"clenches his fists, anticipating battle."
"[BUG]"
""
""
"are here"
"This brawny, heavily-built man stands just a bit taller than the normal height
of an elf; he stands squat and corded with muscle.  Pale skin, bright blue
eyes, and platinum-blond hair and beard reveal him as a northman, a race of
men from far north beyond the Dragonspires.  A long, scraggly beard reaches to
the middle of the man's chest, the strands held together by simple strips of
gray cloth.  A terrible scar runs across the bridge of his nose, healed over
poorly as a wicked purple lump of flesh.  Terrible ritual scarring along his
arms, even purple lines have been covered over with a hash of lighter scars,
evidence of years of swordplay and other combat.  Strong, calloused hands and
a battle-ready stance betray this man as a warrior prepared to fight for his
life.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
