"Ebony in color, this bug-like creature seems to defy nature, holding up its
comparatively large, armor-like shell on only six tiny, needle-thin legs.  The
two front legs are longer than the others, and tipped with over-sized
pincers.  Its small head is eyeless, and seems unable to move about at all. 
Two long, fuzzy feelers protrude from the head, sweeping around and touching
everything near the creature.
"
"Phule"
