""
""
"bug"
"A floating, shimmering image of a girl of indeterminate race.  While she seems
to be young, shimmering, white-hot flames encircle her body, creeping up her
ethereal garments and obscuring her face and hair.  While the flames appear to
have affect in the physical world, throwing off showers of heat, they also
look to affect the spectre; she writhes in agony, any tears she might cry
instantly burning away.  She wails constantly, pitifully, as she floats just
above the stony prison floor, begging anyone who will listen for release.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Kotoktok"
"k = 1d7;
j = 0;
