"enormous wolf of crystalline ice"
""
""
"stands here, wintry breath frosting the air."
"enormous wolf of crystalline ice"
""
""
"stand here in a frozen pack."
"Faceted and sparkling, the surfaces of this extraordinarily large wolf of
translucent ice glimmer softly in the cavern light.  Even larger than the two
wolves that merged to form it, this construct stands as tall as an ogre at the
shoulder.  This creation of ice is extraordinarily detailed - the texture of
individual hairs can be made out along its back.  Frost rimes the air between
the brutal jaws of this fashioned beast, even though its flanks do not move
with breath.  A burning blue light fills the places where the eyes of an
ordinary wolf would be, piercingly bright.  Although the eyes have no pupils,
it seems as if they are looking in all directions simultaneously.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
"rch = mob_in_room( 2544, room );
if( rch ) {
  if( 1d7 == 2 )
    interpret( mob, \"rescue\", rch );
