"exuding green auras glide easily through the air."
"This spirit is a translucent green figure whose image frequently flushes with
brown overtones.  It appears humanoid in form, at least as far as it has
something resembling a head and a torso below it.  The torso tapers to a small
point, and it floats easily above the ground.  A green aura surrounds the
being and distorts the air around it with an earthy glow.
"
