"[Big fat bug]"
""
""
"- Request an immortal at once!"
"Gaunt and skeletal, this creature looks much like a venerable and bent man.
He wears a deep black velvet robe, dessicated hands folded within the broad
sleeves.  The robe is hooded, but the hood thrown back, his head the only
visible flesh exposed.  Were it not for a palpable ocean of power surrounding
him - even when he is at rest, you can feel the magic lapping at you, washing
over as if probing you - his fragile frame could be shattered with a single
great blow.  His leathery face shows not quite an expression of cruelty, but
the cold and patient indifference of a glacier wearing away the stone.  The
most inhuman feature of all, and the one that betrays him as a creature wholly
not mortal, is his eyes.  Each pupil has expanded and fills the entire eye,
deep oil-black pools with a hint of red.  They peer through you, aware of your
presence but seeming to look at things which are not visible to mortal eyes.
"
"Nereus"
""
