"Diana"
""
"retired hero"
""
""
"looks for a comfortable place to erst her weary bones."
"retired heros"
""
""
"look at themselves in confusion."
"While Diana possesses the grace and beauty found in most elves she is by no
stretch of the imagination among the most beautiful of her race.  The signs of
age, so rare in the elven kind, have begun to make their presence known in her
modestly handome visage with touches of gray in the hair and the first signs
