His arms bulge with veins and thick, well-defined musculature.  His shoulders
and back are broad and heavy, as are his slightly bowed legs.  The snow-white
of his skin is set off by the maze of thin black lines that has been tattooed
on his entire body.  His eyes are a malevolent red above his beaky nose, and
his mouth is filled with yellowish fangs.  Thick white strands of hair are
pulled back into charm-laden braids that lie close to his skull.
