""
""
"stands guard over the mausoleum."
"animated suits of black iron"
""
""
"stand guard over the mausoleum."
"A great, ogre-sized animated suit of thick, black iron plate armor.  The armor
is vastly thicker iron than could possibly be worn by someone of that size,
probably weighing in excess of three hundred pounds.  In particular, the
cuirass is nearly an inch thick both in front and back.  Despite the
overwhelming weight, the suit appears to have been scratched and battered in
places as if it had been worn in combat.  The cold iron armor is unordinary
except for its great size and unornamented simplicity.  Two crimson pinpoints
are visible from within a conical helm that sits atop the suit of armor,
implacable and piercing.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
