"ghoulything"
"{behemoth of bone and ice} gnarlgnoth"
""
""
"lumbers along here, misshapen arms dragging the ground."
"{behemoths of bone and ice} gnarlgnoths"
""
""
"lumber along, a pack of monstrosities."
"A strange, living conglameration of ice and bone shambles along here.
Constructed from bones which clearly did not come from the same creature or
even the same species, it somehow is able to walk and move, albeit with no
great agility.  Sturdy femurs of mammoths or horses act as giant, unhinged
legs; small humanoid tibia and humerus bones are somehow held together to form
upper limbs; various other accumulated bones have been used to construct a
broad, misshapen torso.  Atop this collection of bones that serves as a
makeshift skeleton, ice has collected in great pockets, forming additional
cohesion to this skeletal monstrosity.  A skull, humanoid but of some unknown
type, sits on top of the rest of the creature, looking as if it were smashed
onto the rest of the body by some giant hand.  Its empty eye sockets stare
lifelessly ahead, though you have little doubt that this creature can sense
your presence despite the lack of eyes.
"
"Nereus"
""
