inhumanly gaunt, a fact that is somewhat, but not completely, hidden by a
formless ivory robe.  Eyes of milky white stare out at you from the depths of
a hooded robe, seeing nothing.  A subtle movement directs your eyes to the
center of her forehead, where they meet a single, soft-blue eye that seems to
be fully functional.
"
