""
""
"blot out the sky."
"This creature would look just like a standard swamp skliss, if it weren't the
size of a small mountain.  Giant, scaly arms and legs ripple with many tons of
muscle, moving fluidly despite their size.  Its tail is a marvel in itself, as
thick and tall as a treetrunk.  Greenish-grey in color, this enormous foe is
not to be taken lightly.
"
