    act_tochar( #clans, ch );
}
"
E
"newbie_only"
"The gnomes looks you over and says, \"Ah, tis a simple thing I do.  I help the
newer folk in this place.  Ye may be new to this town but ye aren't
particularly new to this realm I see.  Ye should be capable of doing well
enough on yer own.  If ye should see anyone particularly new, though, please
feel free to help out by bringing 'em to me.\"
"
E
"commands"
"I carry goods collected by various clans of the realm with me.  Ye can ask for
a gift from a clan by asking me for one.  Simply enter @bask mage@n followed by
the clan's short name.  That is, if ye wanted a gift from clan IMMS, ye'd ask
mage imms and I'd be giving ye something if they had anything for ye.
"
E
"clans"
"The following clans have decided to help newer players and may have given me
something to give ye:

none at this time.

