"pale furry humanoid runic scars grimling charmer"
"{pale, furry humanoid with runic scars} grimling charmer"
""
""
"dances a mystic jig."
"{pale, furry humanoids with runic scars} grimling charmers"
""
""
"dance together, magic flowing between them."
"Matted and coarse white fur cloaks this male humanoids' body; angry red wounds
have been cut deeply into both fur and flesh in indecipherable patterns.  The
cuts have been smeared with some sort of colorful paste, most likely an
attempt at primitive tattooing or another ritual of this humanoid's religion.
More disturbing than the runic disfigurements is the fact that his mouth has
been sewn shut in a crude pattern of gut stitching, forcing a rather painful
vow of silence upon him.  Locked in an permanent near-squatting position, this
man's back is torturously bent; despite this he constantly hops and capers
about; leaping, giggling, and mumbling despite his facial disfigurement.
"
"Nereus"
""
"Nereus"
"attack_weapon( mob, victim, 2d4, \"right hand\" );
attack_weapon( mob, victim, 2d4, \"left hand\" );
"
