"are here"
"A somewhat slender human woman with just enough muscle tone to give her
flawlessly smooth skin a very healthy appearance.  Her skin is a pale, almost
milky white yet doesn't appear unhealthy, just naturally creamy pale.  A
narrow waist, ample bosom, and well-formed hips provide all the right curves
to insure most men will be enthralled by her beauty.  Long dark tresses of
flowing sable hair are held back by a gleaming silver circlet.  Even her face,
smooth and well-featured displays natural beauty unmarred by age or hardship.
A gentle, almost permanent smile seems to tug at her full red lips and an
almost coy glimmer always in her silvery eyes.
"
"Talis"
""
"Talis"
