"wild-eyed man"
""
""
"sway unsteadily."
"The man before you stands in tattered grey robes, bare shreds all that remain
of once sturdy work robes.  The multitude of cuts and tears look recent and
are stained heavily with blood.  Criss-crossed bloody wounds are clearly
visible between the open slits of fabric.  Perhaps of even more concern is the
way his bloodshot eyes wildly seem to roll about, unable to focus on anything
for more than a fraction of a moment before moving on.  His black hair,
perhaps once neatly arrayed, is not matted with blood and gore with chunk-
filled wisps sticking out at stray angles.  He moves with a very noticeable
staggering gait and looks ready to fall over at any minute.
"
"Talis"
""
