like a practiced warrior.  His fine gray hair and beard are cut short, and
look meticulously groomed.  His face is covered in many fine lines and one
might guess his age at about forty-five, yet his body appears as hale as that
of a man of twenty.  His blue-gray eyes look stern and decisive.
