"Resembling a giant, floating tick, the ethereal outline of a large, six-legged
creature with a rotund body region hovers here near the stone pillar.  Clawed
hands at the end of each arm twitch slowly, in an alien manner that suggests
confusion or even perhaps madness.  A crimson in color, the outline wavers
like a billowing mist, softly shifting in hue between crimson and a blood-red.
The head of the outline is a tenuous, mist-shrouded shape; a gaze of pure,
unsheathed malevolence from a set of three eyes is evident even to one not of
this world.
"
