""
"{tall, graying man with a well-trimmed beard} itinerant priest of Meriada"
""
""
"is here, quietly penning a scroll."
"[BUG]"
""
""
"- contact an immortal."
"This tall, still strong man looks to be in his late fifties.  His beard is
completely gray, well and recently trimmed, and almost entirely conceals a
mostly-healed blade scar that extends vertically from temple to jaw.  Muscle
has run to fat across much of his frame, though despite this extra weight he
is still sturdy enough given his age.  Calloused hands like pincers are
stained now with ink, though his grip was certainly not developed through
hours of scrollwork.  Much more striking than his rather ordinary appearance
are this man's mannerisms: he is detatched and analytical to an almost inhuman
extreme.  His gaze is piercing and lingers where he looks, like a falcon
eyeing a mouse it knows it can swoop down and eat at any moment.
"
"Nereus"
