tasks that I thought no one could accomplish.  This treatise will aid me
greatly in my work.
"
E
"prac"
"say Well, our bargain is complete.  I shall teach you the special move that
cost me everything I thought I loved.  May it bring you a happier fate, and I
hope that you have learned somewhat from me besides violence.
"
