"are here"
"Lonil's mark is apparent on this tall, proud man of middle age.  His radiant
golden hair, streaked as of yet with only small traces of silver, and his
flawless fair skin immediately bring to mind the tales of Lonil's human
incarnations.  Wearing the gold-trimmed white habit of his rank, his posture
is stern and resolute, and he radiates an aura of immense power and light.
Lonil's foes beware.
"
"Nereus"
""
