mouth.  A rather disgusting mix of chocolate, dirt, sugar, and other things
best left to the imagination have been smeared around the mouth-hole of the
sheet.  Absurd-sounding moans and the occasional giggle escape from beneath
the goblin's costume as he roams in search of more candy.
