"stands here alertly, waiting for signs of intruders."
"dark hooded man"
""
""
"stand here alertly, waiting for signs of intruders."
"A tall, foreboding presence which appears to be human, this man stands careful
watch over the doorway before him.  He is shrouded in a black hood, and a long
matching cloak which sweeps the floor.  The only hint of visible colour
besides the black of his clothing is in his piercing, bright blue eyes, which
search constantly about the room, alert for any intruders.  Shapes visible
beneath his cloak hint at unseen weapons - of both the metal and muscular
variety.
"
"Olah"
""
"Olah"
"if( wearing_obj( 1103, mob ) || wearing_obj( 1053, mob ) ) {
  attack( mob, victim, 3d15+20, \"pierce\");
  attack( mob, victim, 3d15+20, \"stab\");
  attack( mob, victim, 4d20+30, \"powerful pierce\" );
  attack( mob, victim, 3d20+20, \"fierce stab\" );
  if( random( 1, 5 ) < 4 )
    attack( mob, victim, 3d20+40, \"flesh-ripping pierce\" );
  if( random( 1, 9 ) < 7 )
    attack( mob, victim, 3d20+45, \"flesh-rending stab\" );
  if( random( 1, 9 ) < 7 ) {
    act_room( #swing, ch );
    loop( all_in_room ) {
      if( is_player( rch ) || is_pet( rch ) ) {
        if( random( 1, 9 ) < 7 )
          attack( mob, rch, 3d20+20, \"melee pierce\" );
      }
    }
  }
}
else {
  attack( mob, victim, 3d10+10, \"punch\" );
  attack( mob, victim, 3d10+10, \"jab\" );
  attack( mob, victim, 3d10+20, \"powerful punch\" );
  attack( mob, victim, 3d10+15, \"fierce jab\" );
  if( random( 1, 5 ) < 4 )
    attack( mob, victim, 3d10+25, \"uppercut\" );
  if( random( 1, 9 ) < 7 )
    attack( mob, victim, 3d10+25, \"kick\" );
  if( random( 1, 9 ) < 7 ) {
    act_room( #punch, ch );
    loop( all_in_room ) {
      if( is_player( rch ) || is_pet( rch ) ) {
        if( random( 1, 9 ) < 7 )
          attack( mob, rch, 3d10+10, \"spinning punch\" );
