"Although muscular and powerful looking by most standards, this grey-skinned
ogre appears slightly more slender than the other ogres.  Her stringy black
hair is braided into several strands that resemble long, scaly serpents.
Rouge face paint accentuates the contours of her fearsome visage.  Skull
tattoos with snakes wrapped around them decorate her thick arms, which extend
down to pointy, sharp nails.  Gazing out, her fiery red eyes point downward,
as though everything around is beneath her.
"
"Olah"
