"Gnurg"
""
"trollish bounty hunter"
""
"hugely muscled"
"stands here menacingly."
"trollish bounty hunter"
""
"hugely muscled"
"stand here menacingly."
"This huge troll towers at over seven feet in height.  He is almost as wide as
he is tall, with muscles which could probably be used pull a laden cart.  He
is warty, as are most trolls, but unlike others he has a thick shock of
reasonably long, straight, jet-black hair, which he is clearly extremely proud
of.  He has bound it back behind his head with a single platinum thread, and
it is woven with small mementos of previous collected bounties - primarily
small fingerbones.
"
"Tsukurite"
""
"Tsukurite"
"attack( mob, victim, 10d5+40, \"slash\" );
attack( mob, victim, 10d4+40, \"hard slap\" );
attack( mob, victim, 15d5+25, \"backhand\" );
attack( mob, victim, 15d4+15, \"swift kick\" );
attack( mob, victim, 20d2+15, \"punch\" );
if( random( 1, 10) == 1 ) {
  interpret( mob, \"bash\" );
  attack( mob, ch, 5d5+20, \"vicious hacking\" );
}
if( i ) {
  if( random( 1, 10) > 8 ) {
    send_to_room( #pierce, room );
    rch = rand_player( room );
    attack( mob, rch, 5d5+25, \"heavy blow\" );
  }
}
"
