"Dyva"
""
"vyaness bounty hunter"
""
"twin"
"stands here, contemplating the structure."
"vyaness bounty hunters"
""
"twin"
"stand here, contemplating the structure."
"This vyan female stands straight, her posture perfect.  She is well-muscled
and lithe, with dark ebon skin and long white hair, tied back with a leather
thong.  Her eyes glint blackly in light, always watching her surroundings.
She appears to be almost a mirror image of her brother, except for a
difference in hair length.  Vyan twins are particularly uncommon, as among all
races of elven ancestry, and it is no wonder that these two remain together.
"
"Tsukurite"
""
"Tsukurite"
"attack( mob, victim, 10d5+40, \"slash\" );
attack( mob, victim, 10d4+40, \"hard slap\" );
attack( mob, victim, 15d5+25, \"backhand\" );
attack( mob, victim, 15d4+15, \"swift kick\" );
attack( mob, victim, 20d2+15, \"punch\" );
if( random( 1, 10) == 1 ) {
  interpret( mob, \"bash\" );
  attack( mob, ch, 5d5+20, \"vicious hacking\" );
}
if( i ) {
  if( random( 1, 10) > 8 ) {
    send_to_room( #pierce, room );
    rch = rand_player( room );
    attack( mob, rch, 5d5+25, \"heavy blow\" );
  }
}
attack( mob, victim, 15d4+15, \"quick slash\" );

if( !rflag( reset1, find_room( 11964 ) ) ) {
  if( random( 1, 2 ) > 1 ) {
    interpret( mob, #howl );
    attack( mob, victim, 20d10+30, \"anguished swiping\" ); }
  }
"
